  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The new dolly feature for the in-game cam is really great! My problem and/or request is about how the flight of this cam ends. I was not able to let it end at the point i wanted to have it. It seems to stop not at the last point but on the point before, or somehow in between both. So this is somewhat unpredictable. The best would be that the starting-point is used as ending-point too so that a closed loop is created.\n\nThen i'd like to have an option to repeat that loop endless til it is stopped manually.\n\nI'm a DJ in VR and like to use the cam/dolly that way, and i can't take care about the cam while playing/streaming. An endless fly-loop would be a big aid.",
